<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Evaluation results of various context compression methods under two base models across long-context tasks. “FT” denotes to the fine-tuned full attention model. Bolded numbers indicate the best results among compression methods.</figcaption>
</figure>
